repository-code: 'https://github.com/TI-Forest-Sector-Modelling/CGE_linking_pipeline'
abstract: |-
  Linking partial equilibrium (PE) models such as TiMBA with other models such as computable general equilibrium (CGE)
  models allows to account for cross-sectoral dynamics which are usually not represented in PE models. By integrating
  these dynamics, TiMBA projections can be refined. TiMBA_Link is designed to automate soft linkages with CGE models
  by aggregating TiMBA results or disaggregating CGE results sector- and region-wise. TiMBA_Link has been developed
  within different research projects (BioSDG and CarbonLeak). For each project, specific linkages have been tailored to
  address different research questions.
